Seat: Mire's Edge (Drowned Lowlands).

Ruler: Elder Ystrid Mire.

Monopoly: Botanical reagents and toxicological extractions.

12,000-Year Heritage: Believes history began 12,000 years ago; has spent twelve millennia mapping toxic swamp plants.

Supply Chain Role: Exclusive harvester of the hyper-toxic root compounds and fungal reagents needed by Shadowfen and the Crown to chemically synthesize Runic Barrier Fuel.

